.TH FL-SESSION 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-session \- start an fldesktop session
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-session\fR [\fIfl-wm options\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP and related variables, reads
\fI~/.config/fldesktop/environment\fR (KEY=value lines), starts a D\-Bus session bus
when none is running and executes \fBfl-wm\fR(1).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LIBDECOR_PLUGIN_DIR
Unless it is set already (for example in the environment file), it is set to an
empty directory in \fBXDG_RUNTIME_DIR\fR: \fBfl-wm\fR(1) draws the window
decorations itself, so libdecor's GTK and cairo plugins are not needed and
applications start faster without them.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
